---

<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <link rel="icon" type="image/svg+xml" href="/favicon.svg" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
    <meta name="description" content="Dirty Laundry — the household chore app that makes housework feel less like a chore. Track what gets done, earn points, and have fun doing it." />
    <meta name="theme-color" content="#FFE500" />
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com" />
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin />
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=IBM+Plex+Mono:wght@400;500;600;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet" />
    <title>Dirty Laundry — Housework, but make it fun</title>
  </head>
  <body>
    <!-- HERO -->
    <section class="hero">
      <div class="container">
        <div class="hero-badge">HOUSEWORK, BUT MAKE IT FUN</div>
        <h1>DIRTY LAUNDRY</h1>
        <p class="hero-tagline">Chores don't have to feel like chores.</p>
        <p class="hero-desc">
          Turn your household to-do list into a game.<br />
          Points. Leaderboards. A little bit of chaos.
        </p>
        <a href="https://app.dirtylaundry.club/auth" class="btn btn-black">GET STARTED</a>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- LIVE STATS -->
    <section class="section bg-black stats-section">
      <div class="container">
        <div class="stats-grid" id="stats-grid">
          <div class="stat">
            <div class="stat-number" id="stat-chores">—</div>
            <div class="stat-label">CHORES COMPLETED</div>
          </div>
          <div class="stat">
            <div class="stat-number" id="stat-points">—</div>
            <div class="stat-label">POINTS EARNED</div>
          </div>
          <div class="stat">
            <div class="stat-number" id="stat-households">—</div>
            <div class="stat-label">HOUSEHOLDS</div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <script>
      async function loadStats() {
        try {
          const res = await fetch('https://ldluxsoyevjrzualmfvo.supabase.co/functions/v1/public-stats')
          const data = await res.json()
          const fmt = (n) => n.toLocaleString('en-GB')
          document.getElementById('stat-chores').textContent = fmt(data.chores_completed)
          document.getElementById('stat-points').textContent = fmt(data.points_earned)
          document.getElementById('stat-households').textContent = fmt(data.households)
        } catch {
          // Leave as dashes
        }
      }
      loadStats()
    </script>

    <!-- PROBLEM -->
    <section class="section bg-white">
      <div class="container">
        <h2>WHY HOUSEWORK SUCKS</h2>
        <div class="card-grid">
          <div class="card card-pink">
            <div class="card-icon">🧠</div>
            <h3>IT'S BORING</h3>
            <p>Nobody wakes up excited to clean the bathroom. Your brain would literally rather do anything else.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="card card-yellow">
            <div class="card-icon">😶‍🌫️</div>
            <h3>IT'S INVISIBLE</h3>
            <p>You spent an hour cleaning and nobody even noticed. Effort without acknowledgement is exhausting.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="card card-lime">
            <div class="card-icon">😵‍💫</div>
            <h3>IT'S OVERWHELMING</h3>
            <p>The list never ends. Where do you even start? So you stare at the mess and do nothing.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- HOW IT WORKS -->
    <section class="section bg-yellow">
      <div class="container">
        <h2>HOW IT WORKS</h2>
        <div class="steps">
          <div class="step">
            <div class="step-number bg-lime">1</div>
            <div class="step-content">
              <h3>CREATE A GROUP</h3>
              <p>Set up your household and invite your partner, housemates, or whoever you share a bin with.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="step">
            <div class="step-number bg-pink">2</div>
            <div class="step-content">
              <h3>ADD YOUR CHORES</h3>
              <p>List the jobs that need doing and assign point values. Scrubbing the oven? That's worth more than wiping a counter.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="step">
            <div class="step-number bg-blue">3</div>
            <div class="step-content">
              <h3>SET THE SPLIT</h3>
              <p>Not everyone has the same free time. Agree on each person's fair share — 40/35/25 or whatever works. Scores adjust automatically.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="step">
            <div class="step-number bg-orange">4</div>
            <div class="step-content">
              <h3>DO THE THING</h3>
              <p>Finished something? Mark it done, earn your points, get a 👏 from your housemate. Instant gratification.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="step">
            <div class="step-number bg-pink">5</div>
            <div class="step-content">
              <h3>WATCH THE LEADERBOARD</h3>
              <p>Weekly reports, who-does-what breakdowns, and a leaderboard that makes housework weirdly competitive.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- MID CTA -->
    <section class="section bg-black mid-cta">
      <div class="container cta">
        <p class="cta-free">100% free. No ads. No catch. No premium tier.</p>
        <a href="https://app.dirtylaundry.club/auth" class="btn btn-yellow">START TRACKING — IT'S FREE</a>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- APP PREVIEW -->
    <section class="section bg-white">
      <div class="container">
        <h2>SEE IT IN ACTION</h2>
        <div class="phone-grid">

          <!-- CHORES SCREEN -->
          <div class="phone">
            <div class="phone-notch"></div>
            <div class="phone-header">
              <span class="phone-title">Our Flat</span>
              <span class="phone-action">+</span>
            </div>
            <div class="phone-filters">
              <span class="pill pill-active">ALL</span>
              <span class="pill">RECURRING</span>
              <span class="pill">ONE-TIME</span>
            </div>
            <div class="phone-body">
              <div class="mock-chore">
                <div class="mock-chore-info">
                  <span class="mock-chore-name">Do the dishes</span>
                  <div class="mock-chore-tags">
                    <span class="mock-tag tag-yellow">15 PTS</span>
                    <span class="mock-tag tag-blue">RECURRING</span>
                  </div>
                </div>
                <span class="mock-check bg-lime">✓</span>
              </div>
              <div class="mock-chore">
                <div class="mock-chore-info">
                  <span class="mock-chore-name">Clean the bathroom</span>
                  <div class="mock-chore-tags">
                    <span class="mock-tag tag-bounty">🔥 50 PTS</span>
                    <span class="mock-tag tag-blue">RECURRING</span>
                  </div>
                  <div class="mock-turn">Tom's turn</div>
                </div>
                <span class="mock-check bg-lime">✓</span>
              </div>
              <div class="mock-chore">
                <div class="mock-chore-info">
                  <span class="mock-chore-name">Take bins out</span>
                  <div class="mock-chore-tags">
                    <span class="mock-tag tag-yellow">10 PTS</span>
                    <span class="mock-tag tag-orange">ONE-TIME</span>
                  </div>
                </div>
                <span class="mock-check bg-lime">✓</span>
              </div>
              <div class="mock-chore">
                <div class="mock-chore-info">
                  <span class="mock-chore-name">Hoover the flat</span>
                  <div class="mock-chore-tags">
                    <span class="mock-tag tag-yellow">20 PTS</span>
                    <span class="mock-tag tag-blue">RECURRING</span>
                  </div>
                </div>
                <span class="mock-check bg-lime">✓</span>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="phone-nav">
              <span class="nav-item nav-active">CHORES</span>
              <span class="nav-item">SCORES</span>
              <span class="nav-item">LOG</span>
              <span class="nav-item">SPIN</span>
              <span class="nav-item">REPORT</span>
            </div>
            <p class="phone-label">CHORES LIST</p>
          </div>

          <!-- LEADERBOARD SCREEN -->
          <div class="phone">
            <div class="phone-notch"></div>
            <div class="phone-header phone-header-yellow">
              <span class="phone-title-center">LEADERBOARD</span>
            </div>
            <div class="phone-body">
              <div class="mock-leader-card">
                <div class="mock-leader">
                  <span class="mock-rank bg-yellow">1</span>
                  <div class="mock-avatar" style="background:#FF2D9B;">S</div>
                  <div class="mock-leader-info">
                    <div class="mock-leader-name-row">
                      <span class="mock-leader-name">Sarah</span>
                      <span class="mock-streak">🔥 7</span>
                    </div>
                    <div class="mock-bar"><div class="mock-bar-fill bg-yellow" style="width:100%;"></div></div>
                  </div>
                  <div class="mock-points">285<span class="mock-pts">PTS</span></div>
                </div>
                <div class="mock-shame">
                  <span class="mock-shame-label">LAST ACTIVE</span>
                  <span class="mock-shame-value">2H AGO</span>
                </div>
              </div>
              <div class="mock-leader-card">
                <div class="mock-leader">
                  <span class="mock-rank bg-pink">2</span>
                  <div class="mock-avatar" style="background:#0066FF;">T</div>
                  <div class="mock-leader-info">
                    <span class="mock-leader-name">Tom</span>
                    <div class="mock-bar"><div class="mock-bar-fill bg-pink" style="width:68%;"></div></div>
                  </div>
                  <div class="mock-points">195<span class="mock-pts">PTS</span></div>
                </div>
                <div class="mock-shame">
                  <span class="mock-shame-label">LAST ACTIVE</span>
                  <div class="mock-shame-row">
                    <span class="mock-shame-warn">4 DAYS AGO</span>
                    <span class="mock-nudge-btn">👀</span>
                  </div>
                </div>
              </div>
              <div class="mock-leader-card">
                <div class="mock-leader">
                  <span class="mock-rank bg-lime">3</span>
                  <div class="mock-avatar" style="background:#FF6B00;">J</div>
                  <div class="mock-leader-info">
                    <span class="mock-leader-name">Jake</span>
                    <div class="mock-bar"><div class="mock-bar-fill bg-lime" style="width:39%;"></div></div>
                  </div>
                  <div class="mock-points">110<span class="mock-pts">PTS</span></div>
                </div>
                <div class="mock-shame">
                  <span class="mock-shame-label">LAST ACTIVE</span>
                  <div class="mock-shame-row">
                    <span class="mock-shame-value">1D AGO</span>
                    <span class="mock-nudge-btn">👀</span>
                  </div>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="phone-nav">
              <span class="nav-item">CHORES</span>
              <span class="nav-item nav-active">SCORES</span>
              <span class="nav-item">LOG</span>
              <span class="nav-item">SPIN</span>
              <span class="nav-item">REPORT</span>
            </div>
            <p class="phone-label">LEADERBOARD</p>
          </div>

          <!-- ACTIVITY SCREEN -->
          <div class="phone">
            <div class="phone-notch"></div>
            <div class="phone-header phone-header-orange">
              <span class="phone-title-center">ACTIVITY</span>
            </div>
            <div class="phone-body">
              <div class="mock-date-label">TODAY</div>
              <div class="mock-activity">
                <div class="mock-avatar-sm" style="background:#FF2D9B;">S</div>
                <div class="mock-activity-info">
                  <span><strong>Sarah</strong> completed <strong>Do the dishes</strong></span>
                  <span class="mock-time">2m ago</span>
                </div>
                <span class="mock-tag tag-yellow">+15</span>
              </div>
              <div class="mock-activity">
                <div class="mock-avatar-sm" style="background:#0066FF;">T</div>
                <div class="mock-activity-info">
                  <span><strong>Tom</strong> completed <strong>Take bins out</strong></span>
                  <span class="mock-time">1h ago</span>
                </div>
                <span class="mock-tag tag-yellow">+10</span>
              </div>
              <div class="mock-date-label">YESTERDAY</div>
              <div class="mock-activity">
                <div class="mock-avatar-sm" style="background:#FF2D9B;">S</div>
                <div class="mock-activity-info">
                  <span><strong>Sarah</strong> completed <strong>Hoover the flat</strong></span>
                  <span class="mock-time">1d ago</span>
                </div>
                <span class="mock-tag tag-yellow">+20</span>
              </div>
              <div class="mock-activity">
                <div class="mock-avatar-sm" style="background:#FF6B00;">J</div>
                <div class="mock-activity-info">
                  <span><strong>Jake</strong> completed <strong>Clean the bathroom</strong></span>
                  <span class="mock-time">1d ago</span>
                </div>
                <span class="mock-tag tag-yellow">+30</span>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="phone-nav">
              <span class="nav-item">CHORES</span>
              <span class="nav-item">SCORES</span>
              <span class="nav-item nav-active">LOG</span>
              <span class="nav-item">SPIN</span>
              <span class="nav-item">REPORT</span>
            </div>
            <p class="phone-label">ACTIVITY LOG</p>
          </div>

        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- TESTIMONIALS -->
    <section class="section bg-white">
      <div class="container">
        <h2>WHAT PEOPLE ARE SAYING</h2>
        <div class="testimonial-grid">
          <div class="testimonial">
            <p class="testimonial-quote">"It's actually fun now? My partner and I race to hit our weekly points. Never thought I'd say that about cleaning."</p>
            <div class="testimonial-author">
              <div class="testimonial-avatar bg-pink">L</div>
              <div>
                <span class="testimonial-name">Laura</span>
                <span class="testimonial-detail">Lives with partner</span>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="testimonial">
            <p class="testimonial-quote">"Three of us in a flat and we actually look forward to the weekly report now. It's become a whole thing. Someone boosted the bathroom to 50 points last week."</p>
            <div class="testimonial-author">
              <div class="testimonial-avatar bg-blue">M</div>
              <div>
                <span class="testimonial-name">Marcus</span>
                <span class="testimonial-detail">3-person flatshare</span>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="testimonial">
            <p class="testimonial-quote">"I have ADHD and the chore roulette is genuinely the only reason my flat isn't a disaster. Spin, do, done."</p>
            <div class="testimonial-author">
              <div class="testimonial-avatar bg-orange">R</div>
              <div>
                <span class="testimonial-name">Ria</span>
                <span class="testimonial-detail">Lives alone (still needs accountability)</span>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- FEATURES -->
    <section class="section bg-yellow">
      <div class="container">
        <h2>FEATURES</h2>
        <div class="card-grid four">
          <div class="feature">
            <div class="feature-icon bg-lime">✓</div>
            <h3>REAL-TIME SCORES</h3>
            <p>Points update instantly. No refresh needed.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="feature">
            <div class="feature-icon bg-pink">⏱️</div>
            <h3>LAST ACTIVE</h3>
            <p>Shows how long since someone last did a chore. A gentle prompt to get moving.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="feature">
            <div class="feature-icon bg-orange">🔥</div>
            <h3>STREAKS</h3>
            <p>Consecutive days of getting stuff done. Keep the streak alive — it's weirdly motivating.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="feature">
            <div class="feature-icon bg-blue">👀</div>
            <h3>NUDGE</h3>
            <p>One tap to give someone a friendly poke. They'll get the hint.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="feature">
            <div class="feature-icon bg-yellow">🎰</div>
            <h3>CHORE ROULETTE</h3>
            <p>Can't decide what to do? Spin the wheel. Takes the thinking out of it.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="feature">
            <div class="feature-icon bg-lime">📊</div>
            <h3>WEEKLY REPORT</h3>
            <p>See who did what this week, this month, or this year. Breakdowns that actually make sense.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="feature">
            <div class="feature-icon bg-pink">🏆</div>
            <h3>LEADERBOARD</h3>
            <p>See who's on top. Nothing motivates like a bit of friendly competition.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="feature">
            <div class="feature-icon bg-orange">📋</div>
            <h3>ACTIVITY LOG</h3>
            <p>Full history of who did what and when. Receipts.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="feature">
            <div class="feature-icon bg-yellow">💰</div>
            <h3>CHORE BOUNTIES</h3>
            <p>Boost a chore's points to bribe someone into doing the gross one. Can't claim your own bounty.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="feature">
            <div class="feature-icon bg-lime">⚖️</div>
            <h3>FAIR ASSIGNMENT</h3>
            <p>Auto-suggests whose turn it is based on who's done it least. No more guessing.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="feature">
            <div class="feature-icon bg-pink">👑</div>
            <h3>MONTHLY CHAMPION</h3>
            <p>Crown the winner each month. Hall of fame on your profile.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="feature">
            <div class="feature-icon bg-blue">👥</div>
            <h3>GROUPS</h3>
            <p>Invite anyone with a code. Works for couples, flatshares, families.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="feature">
            <div class="feature-icon bg-orange">🌙</div>
            <h3>DARK MODE</h3>
            <p>For late-night chore guilt. Easy on the eyes.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="feature">
            <div class="feature-icon bg-lime">🔔</div>
            <h3>PUSH NOTIFICATIONS</h3>
            <p>Reminders, reactions, and nudges — right to your phone. Keeps you in the loop.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="feature">
            <div class="feature-icon bg-blue">⏰</div>
            <h3>CHORE REMINDERS</h3>
            <p>Set a day and time for each chore. Get pinged when it's due. No excuses.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="feature">
            <div class="feature-icon bg-yellow">📱</div>
            <h3>INSTALL AS APP</h3>
            <p>Add to your home screen. Looks and feels like a real app. Because it is.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- CHORE SPLIT -->
    <section class="section bg-white">
      <div class="container">
        <h2>NOT EVERYONE HAS THE SAME FREE TIME</h2>
        <p class="split-intro">
          Some weeks you're working late every night. Other weeks you're off.
          Dirty Laundry lets your group set a <strong>fair chore split</strong> so everyone
          contributes what they can — no guilt, no free rides.
        </p>
        <div class="split-grid">
          <div class="split-card">
            <div class="split-icon">⚖️</div>
            <h3>GROUP-AGREED SPLIT</h3>
            <p>The group owner sets each person's expected share. Everyone can see it. No one can quietly game it.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="split-card">
            <div class="split-icon">📊</div>
            <h3>FAIR SHARE SCORING</h3>
            <p>The report scores you against <strong>your share</strong>, not everyone else's. Hit your target and you're golden — even if someone else did more raw points.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="split-card">
            <div class="split-icon">🧠</div>
            <h3>SMART SUGGESTIONS</h3>
            <p>"Whose turn" factors in your split. If you're set to 20%, you won't get suggested as often as someone at 40%.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="split-example">
          <div class="split-example-header">EXAMPLE: 3-PERSON FLAT</div>
          <div class="split-bars">
            <div class="split-bar-row">
              <div class="split-bar-avatar" style="background:#FF2D9B;">S</div>
              <span class="split-bar-name">Sarah</span>
              <div class="split-bar-track">
                <div class="split-bar-fill bg-pink" style="width:40%;"></div>
              </div>
              <span class="split-bar-pct">40%</span>
            </div>
            <div class="split-bar-row">
              <div class="split-bar-avatar" style="background:#0066FF;">T</div>
              <span class="split-bar-name">Tom</span>
              <div class="split-bar-track">
                <div class="split-bar-fill bg-blue" style="width:35%;"></div>
              </div>
              <span class="split-bar-pct">35%</span>
            </div>
            <div class="split-bar-row">
              <div class="split-bar-avatar" style="background:#FF6B00;">J</div>
              <span class="split-bar-name">Jake</span>
              <div class="split-bar-track">
                <div class="split-bar-fill bg-orange" style="width:25%;"></div>
              </div>
              <span class="split-bar-pct">25%</span>
            </div>
          </div>
          <p class="split-example-note">Jake works 60-hour weeks. The group agreed on 25%. He does his share, no guilt.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- ADHD -->
    <section class="section bg-yellow">
      <div class="container">
        <h2>BUILT FOR BRAINS THAT STRUGGLE WITH CHORES</h2>
        <p class="adhd-intro">
          If you've ever stared at a messy kitchen and felt completely paralysed —
          you're not lazy. You might just have a brain that needs a different system.
          Dirty Laundry was built with that in mind.
        </p>
        <div class="adhd-grid">
          <div class="adhd-card">
            <div class="adhd-icon">🎯</div>
            <h3>DECISION FATIGUE?</h3>
            <p><strong>"Whose turn"</strong> tells you exactly what to do next. No staring at the mess wondering where to start.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="adhd-card">
            <div class="adhd-icon">🎰</div>
            <h3>CAN'T START?</h3>
            <p><strong>Chore roulette</strong> makes it random and a bit fun. Spin the wheel, do the thing. Takes the weight off choosing.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="adhd-card">
            <div class="adhd-icon">🏆</div>
            <h3>NEED DOPAMINE?</h3>
            <p><strong>Points, reactions, and leaderboards</strong> turn boring tasks into a game. Your brain wants a reward — here it is.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="adhd-card">
            <div class="adhd-icon">🔔</div>
            <h3>OUT OF SIGHT, OUT OF MIND?</h3>
            <p><strong>Push reminders and nudges</strong> are your external memory. The app remembers so you don't have to.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="adhd-card">
            <div class="adhd-icon">⚖️</div>
            <h3>GUILT SPIRAL?</h3>
            <p><strong>The chore split</strong> means you're only measured against your own capacity. Bad week? Adjust the share. No shame.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="adhd-card">
            <div class="adhd-icon">👏</div>
            <h3>NEED ACKNOWLEDGEMENT?</h3>
            <p><strong>Reactions on completions</strong> mean your effort gets seen. A 👏 from a housemate goes a long way.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- CTA -->
    <section class="section bg-black">
      <div class="container cta">
